# Badger Architecture

Current Stable Components

- CLI (`@hridhin-k/badger-cli`)
- Tunnel Server (`@hridhin-k/badger-server`)
- Shared protocol (`@hridhin-k/badger-shared`)
- Tunnel Protocol
- Local Proxy
- Request Forwarder
- Tunnel Manager

Stable Contracts

- Tunnel protocol messages
- CLI commands (`badger`; deprecated alias `looplink`)
- WebSocket protocol
- Public URL generation

Future Modules

- Event Bus
- Traffic Recorder
- Inspector
- Dashboard (`@hridhin-k/badger-dashboard` — scaffold only; REST/WS client only)
- AI Engine
- Plugin SDK

Rules

Never rewrite stable modules.

New features must be added as separate modules.

Prefer composition through interfaces.

Avoid coupling new modules directly to forwarding logic.

Prefer events over direct service calls.

The Dashboard must never import server internals.
